signupConfirm.body:
Hello,

Someone, probably you, asked {operator} to tell this address when the site {site} is ready{future, select, true { and about future elections on it} other {}}.

To confirm, open this link and press “Confirm”:
{confirmUrl}

If it wasn’t you, ignore this email: the address will be deleted within 7 days. Or delete it now:
{unsubscribeUrl}

How we handle your address: {privacyUrl}

{operator}

invitation.body:
Hello,

{inviter} has invited this address to work on {site}, on {platform}, as {role}.

To accept, open this link within {days} days. If you have no account yet, you choose your name and a password there, and then set up two-step verification:
{link}

If you didn't expect this, ignore this email: nothing happens unless the link is opened.

{platform}

passwordChanged.body:
Hello,

The password of the account with this address on {platform} was just changed, with a link sent to this address. Every session of the account was signed out, and signing in still asks for the code from your authenticator app.

If it wasn't you, someone may be reading your email. Secure your email account first, then choose a new password here and tell whoever manages your site's members:
{signIn}

{platform}
